	"text_info": [
		{
			"text_contents": "none",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "You, not go far in. Huge, black\nmerman suddenly appear.<1\"\u0000>\nMe heard, just other day,\nexpedition team, attacked<1\"\u0000>\nand wiped out.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I am \"<17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2Ě耀>{3, name, +}\", the\nIncarnation of Electricity.<1\"\u0000>\nDenpa Men, it seems you were\nentrusted the Orbs...<1\"\u0000>\nBut my scanning eyes didn't\ndetect much power within you.<1\"\u0000>\nShow me your power to\nprove my scans wrong.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Oho... Very well. In that\ncase, there's no need to<1\"\u0000>\nhold back. Give it your\nall. I won't go down<1\"\u0000>\nwihtout a proper fight!",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Knowing when to retreat is also\na form of strength.<1\"\u0000>\nIf preparation is required,\nmake sure to get everything<1\"\u0000>\nin order.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Are you challenging me?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I have seen your power with my\nown eyes. Take pride in<1\"\u0000>\nthe fact that you have\ndefeated me, the Incarnation<1\"\u0000>\nof Electricity. I'm filled with<1\"\u0000>\ngratitude that you were\nproving my scans wrong and<1\"\u0000>\nengaged in such meaningful\nbattle...",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I am \"<17\u0003>{8, MessageNpcName, +}<2<耀>{4, message}\", the\nElder Ice Fairy.<1\"\u0000>\nI have been waiting for the\narrival of the one who<1\"\u0000>\nis in the possesion of the\n\"<17\u0003>{5, ItemData, +}<2²耀>{3, name, +}\". To you, who<1\"\u0000>\nholds this proof, I will lend\nyou my strenght - however modest<1\"\u0000>\nit may be - for your\nadventure.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Well then, I look forward to\nworking with you.<1\"\u0000>\nI'll head over to your\nisland shortly.<1\"\u0000>\nWhenever you return safely\nto the island, please feel free<1\"\u0000>\nto give me a call.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Oh my, well, well...\nUnfortunately, it seems<1\"\u0000>\nthere's no room left\nin your Denpa Men Box.<1\"\u0000>\nIf you have an available\nspot in the future,<1\"\u0000>\nplease let me know.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Right...is there anything else\nI can do for you? If you<1\"\u0000>\never need help, please don't\nhesitate to let me know.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I'll head straight tot your\nisland shortly. There, I'll be<1\"\u0000>\nwaiting for your return.\nLet me put my strength<1\"\u0000>\nto good use in your\nfuture adventures.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "When the Denpa Men Box has an\navailable spot, please come<1\"\u0000>\nback to me again.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Is there a need for my help?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": false,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": true
		}
